<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank sets FinMin O/N sell and buy tender.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank sets FinMin O/N sell and buy tender.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Friday set an overnight sell and buy tender for the Finance Ministry with a limit rate of 16.2 percent, down from 18.2 percent in a similar operation on June 30.</p>
<p>The CNB set the deadline for bids in the operation for 0800 GMT and said two bids would be accepted at a minimum of 100 million crowns each.</p>
<p>-- Alan Crosby, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
